    {
      "id": "claim_a806b85634c24c0bbb272e9e3d465b4d",
      "statement": "docsweep inject writes at most two things into a target project: .docsweep.yaml only if it does not already exist (an existing file is left untouched and reported as skipped), and a managed block delimited by literal docsweep:managed:start/end HTML comment markers inside CLAUDE.md (and inside AGENTS.md only if that file already exists).",
