      "id": "claim_46efb7812307453e9d18fc7455dca827",
      "statement": "_write_managed_file() compares the current managed block's content hash against the hash recorded from the last inject run in the manifest, and if the block was hand-edited in between (hash mismatch), it logs a warning and writes a private backup of the entire file into docsweep's own manifest directory (inject-backups/, outside the project) before overwriting, rather than silently discarding the hand edit.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docsweep/inject/api.py#L653-L697",
